{title: More About Jesus}
{artist: Eliza Hewitt & John Sweney}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 84}

Verse 1
[F]More about Jesus [Bb]would I know, [F]more of his grace to [C]others show,
[F]more of his saving [Bb]fullness see, [F]more of his [C]love who [F]died for me.

Chorus
[F]More, more about [Bb]Jesus, [F]more, more about [C]Jesus:
[F]more of his saving [Bb]fullness see, [F]more of his [C]love who [F]died for me.
